[[3,63,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a, 1b) from the control\nunit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890837\">M70A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Climate control system control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890840\">M70B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Press retainer (2a) and disconnect it and then press retainer\n(2b) and keep the control unit (2c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035310.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the control unit is undamaged.</p><p>Position the control unit and fit it to\nthe retainers.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections .</p><p><a href=\"#/2892211\">7040L20</a></p><p>Check the operation of the control unit\nusing the Examiner or another tester.</p>"]]